{"id": "spring-websocket/src/main/java/org/springframework/web/socket/sockjs/transport/session/AbstractHttpSockJsSession.java::190::0", "file": "spring-websocket/src/main/java/org/springframework/web/socket/sockjs/transport/session/AbstractHttpSockJsSession.java", "module": "spring-websocket", "block_start": 190, "start": 191, "end": 197, "indent": "\t", "lines": ["Handle the first request for receiving messages on a SockJS HTTP transport", "based session.", "<p>Long polling-based transports (e.g. \"xhr\", \"jsonp\") complete the request", "after writing the open frame. Streaming-based transports (\"xhr_streaming\",", "\"eventsource\", and \"htmlfile\") leave the response open longer for further", "streaming of message frames but will also close it eventually after some", "amount of data has been sent."]}
{"id": "spring-websocket/src/main/java/org/springframework/web/socket/sockjs/transport/session/AbstractHttpSockJsSession.java::242::0", "file": "spring-websocket/src/main/java/org/springframework/web/socket/sockjs/transport/session/AbstractHttpSockJsSession.java", "module": "spring-websocket", "block_start": 242, "start": 243, "end": 249, "indent": "\t", "lines": ["Handle all requests, except the first one, to receive messages on a SockJS", "HTTP transport based session.", "<p>Long polling-based transports (e.g. \"xhr\", \"jsonp\") complete the request", "after writing any buffered message frames (or the next one). Streaming-based", "transports (\"xhr_streaming\", \"eventsource\", and \"htmlfile\") leave the", "response open longer for further streaming of message frames but will also", "close it eventually after some amount of data has been sent."]}
